# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that the time required for the building of a Krylov subspace initially "
"exceeds the time required for numpy's full diagonalization. But as the size "
"of the matrix grows, the Krylov method becomes advantageous. This is true "
"even if we lower our acceptable error, but the advantage sets in at a larger"
